{{Documentation|self_doc=true}}
This template is meant to be used alongside [[Template:MaterialRates]]. Data comes from DropItem.csv.

==Parameters==
This parameter takes 12 unnamed parameters and 3 named ones. The first 4 unnamed parameters specify the factor to multiply by in each crown difficulty, and the remaining 8 are max drop counts per stage. <code>crowns</code> and <code>stages</code> each specify the number of available crowns and stages in the subchapter respectively. <code>noheading</code> hides the heading automatically included in this template if anything is passed to it.

==Usage==
<pre>
{{MaterialDrops|0.75|1|1.25|1.25|3|3|3|3|3|4|4|4|crowns=3|stages=6|noheading=}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{MaterialDrops|0.75|1|1.25|1.25|3|3|3|3|3|4|4|4|crowns=3|stages=6|noheading=}}

